    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e8f22c1d989496e746d6a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🛍️我们的微信：All-about-losers，来交朋友啊！如果你也喜欢我们的内容，点击订阅不迷路，每周四准时上线！</span></p><p><span>🔈春节期间你可能看到这样的新闻标题“湖南95后女生春节期间上门做饭，月入5万”，巧的是我们刚好认识这位95后私厨-曾恋，而且有幸吃过她做的饭！如果你对这份高收入的小众行业好奇，那不妨来听一听曾恋的故事。</span></p><p><span>📒Shownote</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 令人好奇的预告</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 95后上门私厨震撼登场</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">02:39</a> 活动策划改行做厨师是什么体验</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> 烹饪是一种情绪的疗愈</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> 家人不干涉，丝滑脱掉孔乙己的长衫</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 做上门私厨的困难你可能想象不到</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 上门私厨月入5万是真的吗？真实收入大揭秘！</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 客户的差评和期待逼我自己卷自己</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> 我的生意太火爆！</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="883">14:43</a> 专业素养之清晰明确的工作准则</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> 奇奇怪怪的客户be like，不对劲的同行be like，令人愤怒的客户和网络喷子be like</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1252">20:52</a> 私厨和家政可是不一样的哦</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 神仙客户让人终身铭记</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1433">23:53</a> 沉浸式体验当私厨的一天，这个行业绝对不是会做饭就能干！</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1672">27:52</a> 认清现实，放弃开饭店的梦想，专注私厨</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1764">29:24</a> 如何进化成脑子清醒的95后</span></p><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 好治愈的结尾</span></p><p><span>🎵结尾曾恋分享歌曲《Yesterday once more》— Carpenters</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/68008bf90b86ae7ac19f609b/lq5kcqdRx_Sk_GlsI3clQje8oK94.m4a" length="36576301" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:41</itunes:duration>
