  <item>
    <title>E15｜刚读上985就辍学，这位销冠后悔了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69dfb87fe2c8be315550dc4a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69dfb87fe2c8be315550dc4a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 Apr 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🛍️我们的微信：All-about-losers，来交朋友啊！如果你也喜欢我们的内容，点击订阅不迷路，每周三准时上线！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔈本期嘉宾阿正，是碧碧的前租客，因为阿正的一次失恋，原本微妙的房东和租客之间的博弈关系，上升成了互帮互助的革命友谊，碧碧也在此时发现，这位租客不简单：刚读上985大学就辍学；走南闯北边打工边创业为父母还债；文凭劣势但在大厂常年当销冠...普通90后的人生 “容错率”究竟高不高？让阿正来为我们揭晓。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📒Shownote</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 令人头大的预告</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 西安长大的温州人生活在广州</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 租客和房东互评时间（人间有真情版）</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a> 主业副业两手抓的工作狂</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">06:57</a> 温州人的挣钱史</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> 985大学辍学的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">09:39</a> 18岁开始创业，从业领域横跨服装、餐饮、租赁、医药、互联网</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 原来不同人，对待工作的态度大不相同！</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">19:38</a> 父母做生意挖的坑，我一个人一点点填平</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">22:22</a> 没有读完大学，我真的后悔了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a> 自学大专学历也能玩转互联网大厂</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1712">28:32</a> 泪目，细数成为销冠这一路受过的伤</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2119">35:19</a> 销冠的秘籍大分享！</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2188">36:28</a> 全家人围着钱团团转be like</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 养小猫小狗最重要的是责任感</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a> 淡淡忧伤的结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵结尾阿正分享歌曲《In Need》— Gret Taberner</span></p>]]></description>
